# Force LF on checkout for text files, but let git auto-detect binaries.
# text=auto 让 git 按内容启发式判断二进制（如 .tar.gz / 二进制 .txt），
# 避免 `* eol=lf` 那种"全当文本强转 LF"把二进制文件 CRLF 污染的坑
#（2026-10-02 真机发现 vendor 下两个 .tar.gz/.txt 被污染）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Always-binary regardless of heuristics
*.gz    binary
*.tar   binary
*.tgz   binary
*.zip   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.ogg   binary
*.webm  binary
*.so    binary
*.lmo   binary
*.mmdb  binary
*.mrs   binary
*.idx   binary
*.pack  binary
*.rev   binary

# Make sh/lua explicit for reviewers; same effect as * eol=lf but readable
*.sh  eol=lf
*.lua eol=lf

# 字节级保真的测试夹具与二进制（不得做任何 CRLF/LF 转换）
# 2026-10-02：这两个文件在 Debian 真机 checkout 时被 `* eol=lf` 误转，
# 字节数变了（tar.gz 768249→768233，binary-data.txt 1162→1147）。
vendor/luci/luci-lib-nixio/axTLS/httpd/kepler-1.1-snapshot-20070521-1825.tar.gz binary
